Fixed Oculus CV1 Support;
  Added full  Xbox Controller support;
  Fixed KANT Controls (SteamVR) for both Left Hand and Right Hand;
  Flat Screen support added;
  Keyboard&Mouse controls  as well as Steering wheel (test mode) support added; 
  Crushing and some other minor bugs fixed. 

Thanks to all for your interest and patience, we are continuing working on improvements.

